V8: "[modules] Do not cache star exports after linking" (crbugs 574038247
and 576122750, not public; no CVE listed yet): caching star-exported
bindings into a module's export table after linking could invalidate the
LoadIC handler indices of an already-finalized module namespace. V8 main
commit 137e7f93d730ffb014c50967e1a1c1c9ace186a5, merged on 2026-11-02 to
15.7 (97ff9a7e1b5bc37923377d29afb1a6bda0a1f9b9, for 157; not yet rolled
into the 157 branch). This is the 15.7 merge, at v8/, without its test.
Drop it once a 157 tag's V8 has it.

